I love polls and I love math.

00:10:21.667 --> 00:10:22.868
-Yeah.
-And I just want to get

00:10:22.868 --> 00:10:24.901
to know the the world.
-What people think, yeah.

00:10:24.901 --> 00:10:26.434
-Yeah, Americans, New Yorkers,
anything.

00:10:26.434 --> 00:10:28.033
I just love -- I'm interested.
-Wow.

00:10:28.033 --> 00:10:29.868
-So that's why we do
the "Tonight Show" polls.

00:10:29.868 --> 00:10:31.767
-Very scientific.
-Yeah, but they're

00:10:31.767 --> 00:10:33.601
