They're very, very interesting.

00:10:33.601 --> 00:10:35.801
Everyone wants to know
about these polls.

00:10:35.801 --> 00:10:38.934
The first poll says,
"What is your favorite sport?"

00:10:38.934 --> 00:10:41.868
-Wow.
-40% said, "Football."

00:10:41.868 --> 00:10:43.901
-Whoa.
-30% said, "Basketball."

00:10:43.901 --> 00:10:45.467
20% said, "Baseball."

00:10:45.467 --> 00:10:47.300
8% said, "Formula 1."

00:10:47.300 --> 00:10:49.934
2% said, "Depends on which one
Taylor shows up at."

00:10:49.934 --> 00:10:51.601
-Oh.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:51.601 --> 00:10:53.434
-Their favorite sport.
-Favorite, favorite.

00:10:53.434 --> 00:10:55.501
-Good sport.

00:10:55.501 --> 00:10:58.701
This next poll said,
"What is the best way

00:10:58.701 --> 00:11:01.067
to get out of a costume party?"
-Oh.

00:11:01.067 --> 00:11:02.601
20% said, "Say you're sick."

00:11:02.601 --> 00:11:04.868
20% said,
"Say you're out of town."

00:11:04.868 --> 00:11:07.400
60% said, "Say your dressed
as the Speaker of the House

00:11:07.400 --> 00:11:09.501
and just don't show up."
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:11:09.501 --> 00:11:11.868
Great costume.
-Great costume.

00:11:11.868 --> 00:11:14.167
